      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Kang's invasion of Earth is in full swing, but suddenly the Master of the World rises to stop him! The former foe of Alpha Flight is back, and he's not about to let his planet become one of the Conqueror's serfdoms! Now, caught between these two warring villains, the squad sends a special Avengers Espionage Team to penetrate the heart of the Master's stronghold! Plus: the Triune Understanding situation rushes towards a climax!"
